        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert academic mentor. Your task is to evaluate a student's research submission based on the provided rubric criteria.\n\n---\nRUBRIC CRITERIA:\n{{JSON.stringify($node[\"Fetch Submission Details\"].json[\"data\"][\"rubric\"][\"criteria\"])}}\n\n---\nSUBMISSION CONTENT:\n{{$node[\"Fetch Submission Details\"].json[\"data\"][\"content_text\"]}}\n\n---\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n1. Evaluate EACH rubric criterion individually\n2. Assign a score from 0 to the max_score for each criterion\n3. Calculate the total overall_score as a number between 0 and 100\n4. Write detailed general_feedback (minimum 3 sentences)\n5. List specific flagged_issues as an array of strings (can be empty array)\n6. Provide a short edited_excerpt (improved version of a key section)\n\nYou MUST respond with ONLY a valid JSON object. No explanation, no markdown code blocks, no extra text. Only pure JSON:\n{\n  \"overall_score\": <number between 0-100>,\n  \"general_feedback\": \"<detailed multi-sentence feedback>\",\n  \"flagged_issues\": [\"<issue 1>\", \"<issue 2>\"],\n  \"edited_excerpt\": \"<improved excerpt from the submission>\",\n  \"rubric_scores\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion\": \"<exact criterion name from rubric>\",\n      \"score\": <number>,\n      \"max_score\": <number>,\n      \"comment\": \"<specific comment for this criterion>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
